1
00:00:05,212 --> 00:00:08,092
(Leonard:)Oh, damn it. Can I have a napkin?

2
00:00:08,715 --> 00:00:10,845
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, no.

3
00:00:11,551 --> 00:00:13,341
But you have a whole bunch of them.

4
00:00:13,511 --> 00:00:16,891
(Sheldon:)Yes, I've moved
to a four-napkin system.

5
00:00:17,057 --> 00:00:20,517
(Sheldon:)Lap, hands, face
and personal emergency.

6
00:00:21,728 --> 00:00:24,858
(Sheldon:)If you like, starting tomorrow
I'll add a guest napkin...

7
00:00:25,023 --> 00:00:28,313
(Sheldon:)...but I'm afraid
there's nothing I can do for you today.

8
00:00:31,613 --> 00:00:33,993
(Sheldon:)Good luck. That's the face napkin.

9
00:00:35,742 --> 00:00:38,952
(Howard:)-So have you talked to Penny yet?
-No, I haven't.

10
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:41,160
(Howard:)-Why not?
-Because I've been busy.

11
00:00:41,331 --> 00:00:43,791
(Leonard:)Because I haven't figured out a way
to bring it up.

12
00:00:43,959 --> 00:00:46,289
(Leonard:)And mostly,
and I can't stress how key this is...

13
00:00:46,461 --> 00:00:48,751
(Leonard:)...because I don't want to.

14
00:00:48,922 --> 00:00:51,762
(Howard:)A pact is a pact.
You have to get Penny to fix me up.

15
00:00:51,925 --> 00:00:54,215
(Leonard:)It's not that simple.
What am I supposed to say?

16
00:00:54,386 --> 00:00:57,766
"Penny, you have any friends
you'd like to never hear from again?"

17
00:00:57,931 --> 00:01:04,021
Come on. I'm smart, I have a good job.
And I have only 3 percent body fat.

